<title>Turkmenistan: Turkmen Jan-Sept natural gas production rises.</title>
<headline>Turkmen Jan-Sept natural gas production rises.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAT 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan's production of natural gas increased in the first three quarters of 1996 to 27.06 billion cubic metres, a rise of 20.4 percent on last year's figure, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The committee released the following figures for energy output in its latest statistical review:</p>
<p> TURKMEN ENERGY OUTPUT	     Sept	  Aug     Jan-Sept 96</p>
<p>Natural gas</p>
<p>  (billion cubic metres)	   2.553	 2.346	27.064</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change		+8.8	 +18.3	   n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr pct change		   n/a	   n/a	 +20.4</p>
<p> Crude oil (tonnes)		369,000     378,900   3,235,400</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change		-2.6	  +4.3	   n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change		 n/a	   n/a	  +0.3</p>
<p> Gasoline (tonnes)		  46,800	47,100     549,900</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct changed	     -0.6	  +0.6	   n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr   pct change		 n/a	   n/a	 +22.4</p>
<p> Diesel (tonnes)		   108,400     112,400   1,107,600</p>
<p>  mth/mth pct change		-3.6	  +4.1	   n/a</p>
<p>  yr/yr change			 n/a	   n/a	  +4.9</p>
<p> Fuel oil (mazut) (tonnes)     140,300     139,900   1,177,100</p>
<p>   mth/mth pct change	     +0.3	 +18.4	   n/a</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change		  n/a	   n/a	  +7.9</p>
<p>-- Almaty Newsroom +7 327 509410</p>
